[00:15.75]Read the excerpt from a science fiction story and find out what happened to Tina and Tom.阅读这篇科幻故事节选，了解蒂娜和汤姆身上发生了什么。
[00:23.43]Aliens Arrive.外星人降临。
[00:26.64]Tina woke up at midnight.蒂娜半夜醒了过来。
[00:30.13]She looked out of her window and saw a yellow light in the sky.她望向窗外，看到天空中有一道黄色的光。
[00:35.42]It suddenly dived towards the ground.那道光突然朝地面俯冲下来。
[00:38.79]She heard a noise, and saw a red light.她听到一阵声响，还看到了一道红光。
[00:43.22]The next morning, Tina mentioned it to her brother Tom.第二天早上，蒂娜把这件事告诉了弟弟汤姆。
[00:56.63]"I'm sure something landed in the forest near the hills, as I heard a loud noise last night," she said.“我肯定有什么东西落在了山附近的森林里，因为我昨晚听到了一声巨响，”她说。
[01:05.75]"Let's go and explore after school tonight."“我们今晚放学后去探险吧。”
[01:09.91]At 6:00 PM, Tina and Tom reached the forest.下午6点，蒂娜和汤姆到达了森林。
[01:15.38]They heard some voices speaking a strange language, so they hid behind some bushes and kept quiet.他们听到有人用一种奇怪的语言交谈，于是躲到灌木丛后面，保持安静。
[01:23.60]Then they saw an alien.他们看到了一个外星人。
[01:27.06]It was tall, with a round head and a silver body.它个子很高，有着圆圆的头和银色的身体。
[01:32.32]It was standing next to a long spaceship.它站在一艘长长的宇宙飞船旁边。
[01:36.55]The spaceship was damaged because of a crash.那艘宇宙飞船因坠毁而受损。
[01:40.49]Suddenly, another alien appeared from the bushes in front of them.突然，另一个外星人从他们面前的灌木丛中出现。
[01:46.41]The children were frightened.孩子们吓坏了。
[01:48.76]But then, Tom got a feeling at the back of his throat.但就在这时，汤姆的喉咙深处一阵发痒。
[01:52.99]He couldn't stop himself and coughed loudly.他忍不住大声咳嗽起来。
[01:57.83]The aliens saw them both, and made a terrible noise.外星人看到了他们俩，发出了一阵可怕的声响。
[02:05.32]The children ran away in fear.孩子们吓得跑开了。
[02:09.26]The next day, Tina and Tom told their parents about the strange creatures.第二天，蒂娜和汤姆把这些奇怪生物的事告诉了父母。
[02:15.97]"They were very ugly. They had some hair, but they didn't have any feathers," said Tina.“它们长得很丑，身上有一些毛发，但没有羽毛，”蒂娜说。
[02:24.66]"There was something written on the spaceship," said Tom. "It looked like this. I wonder what it means."“宇宙飞船上写着什么东西，”汤姆说，“看起来是这样的。我不知道是什么意思。”
[02:34.08]He drew some lines on a piece of paper.他在一张纸上画了几道线条。
[02:37.84]Dad looked at them as if they were crazy.爸爸看着他们，仿佛觉得他们疯了一样。
[02:45.33]"Since no one else saw these aliens, I refuse to believe you. Now go to school."“既然没有其他人看到这些外星人，我可不信你们的话。现在去上学吧。”
[02:52.94]The children spread their wings and flew to school together.孩子们展开翅膀，一起飞向了学校。
[02:58.59]Dad looked at the piece of paper with the strange marks on it.爸爸看着那张画着奇怪符号的纸。
[03:04.13]"It looks strange," he said, as he looked at the word.“这看起来真奇怪，”他盯着那个字说道。

